  "title": "Umuahia North/Umuahia South/Ikwuano federal constituency",
  "content": "Umuahia North/Umuahia South/Ikwuano is a federal constituency in Abia State, Nigeria. It covers Umuahia North, Umuahia South and Ikwuano local government areas in the state. Umuahia North/Umuahia South/Ikwuano is represented by Obi Aguocha of the Labour Party of Nigeria.\n\n\n== References ==",
